## Non-negotiables
1. **No invented facts.** Never invent numbers, specs, dates, prices, reviews, ratings or scarcity. Unknowns become
   `[VERIFY: …]` and get added to `ops/open-items.md`.
2. **Every catalog/product fact carries a source** (`field | url | accessed | verbatim quote`). Method: the
   `fact-research` skill. Allowed sources, in order: {{official → distributor → dataset}}. Banned sources: {{list}}.
3. **Images:** own photos > official/distributor assets (credited). Never other sellers' or marketplace images.
   Every image records `source` + `license_note`.
4. **Banned claims:** {{e.g. investment talk, health claims, implied partnerships, fake scarcity}}.
5. **Independent QA.** Producers never score their own work. The `judge` agent scores against `qa/rubrics/*.yaml`
   (protocol: `qa-scorecard` skill). PASS = ≥ 80 weighted, no criterion < 6, hard gates pass. Launch-critical
   ({{list pages}}) needs ≥ 85. Max 3 revise rounds, then escalate to {{owner}}. Only the main session appends to
   `qa/ledger.jsonl`.
6. **Mobile rules below apply to every page.** Verify on a real iPhone (Safari + Chrome) before calling UI done.

